-- Generated by cmd/scrape -only=legends on 2026-09-08.
-- 25161 movedetails rows, 22179 legendsmovevalues rows, from Bulbapedia's
-- Legends: Arceus / Legends: Z-A learnset entries.
--
-- Gap-fill only, same as 000009's egg moves: movedetails inserts are each
-- individually WHERE NOT EXISTS-guarded (no unique constraint on that
-- table); legendsmovevalues rows are deduplicated here on its real PK
-- (pokemon_id, move_id, version) -- a move learnable both by level-up and
-- tutor/TM in the same game (e.g. Legends: Arceus's Iron Tail for Pikachu)
-- has identical stats regardless of learn method, so one row serves every
-- movedetails row for that (pokemon, move, version) triple -- and ON
-- CONFLICT DO NOTHING backs that up at apply time too.

